// Explorer, a pinned taskbar entry and Alt-Tab read the icon straight out of
// the .exe, so setWindowIcon() in main.cpp cannot cover them -- it only reaches
// the windows of a process that is already running. Qt's QT_TARGET_RC_ICONS
// does not help: its generator runs only for targets built as part of Qt
// itself, never for qt_add_executable.
//
// Numeric id 1 on purpose. The shell shows the icon group with the lowest id,
// and a symbolic name would sort as a string instead.
1 ICON "appicon.ico"
